e Information, the company has been testing at least three versions with reduced high-bandwidth memory, some as low as 192GB to 256GB, well below the 1 terabyte Jensen Huang originally announced.', 'tier': 'rumour', 'speaker': 'Insider Monkey', 'original_who': 'The Information', 'original_day': ''}\nold-1/package-2026-08-28 1 Will NVIDIA complete an investment in Firmus Technologies’ preference shares by December 31, 2026? Yes {'<': 0, '>': 0, '&': 132, '\\u2028': 0, '\\u2029': 0} 255 ['afr.com']\n{'id': 'e217', 'one_line': 'NVIDIA has indicated interest in about US$500 million of Firmus preference shares, intended to convert to ordinary equity at Firmus’ IPO later in 2026.', 'quote': 'Street Talk can reveal that the $US4.9 trillion chip developer has put up its hand for about $US500 million ($721 million) worth of Firmus’ preference shares, which are designed to convert to ordinary equity at the initial public offering later this year.', 'tier': 'rumour', 'speaker': 'afr.com, citing Street Talk', 'original_who': 'afr.com / Street Talk (unnamed sources)', 'original_day': ''}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
